a-partnereventstore="[{&quot;gid&quot;:&quot;713414759190366803&quot;,&quot;clan_steamid&quot;:&quot;103582791468571009&quot;,&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;Next Fest October 2026 - LIVE NOW&quot;,&quot;event_type&quot;:20,&quot;appid&quot;:0,&quot;server_address&quot;:null,&quot;server_password&quot;:null,&quot;rtime32_start_time&quot;:1792429200,&quot;rtime32_end_time&quot;:1793034000,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;creator_steamid&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;last_update_steamid&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;event_notes&quot;:&quot;see announcement body&quot;,&quot;jsondata&quot;:&quot;{\&quot;localized_subtitle\&quot;:[\&quot;\&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;localized_summary\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;localized_title_image\&quot;:[\&quot;34dd727407126ba4b68d0a8fe197f3e625c05fb4.jpg\&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;localized_capsule_image\&quot;:[\&quot;277d4d10b3665d199e4cfcca509c6e068609a407.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;05c43d59bfacfe780281fbe28b86e9bcb4fc9639.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;7fcb377becd8e1afe706cbba27b557020656cf97.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;728164e8cb9adbfac806a80da36dd8af2a855c88.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;f0dde063ce864e6a98d97d39fad41408b6a9dfb9.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;aae594af9fa10c5420a6f4c6bf534ee73b548c8a.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;7c558e81c7d3f132ace3c9bbe4ab37b433bd5abb.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;54f86aeb68fab2d0e1348b1f8c63900892e855ae.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;6b79963c6dd991489b25fe33d61fce2a386ce520.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;b087171dea6280b4604ad36e4de40849a0dc015e.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;fcf7aa34f96d6a41f62d55ffa4e089894fbe8cf6.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;26717b702cf228795f64cd2aedb4d2f725e25554.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;f2eb348c2ade8b4571eae5d8996746cb2a502925.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;9409f6de79836af041b573c81339be9d6ebab5cd.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;25fb37158c1dc56c440fb0a0918e1a4f16e510a9.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;eeb464fb2c73ef24f50fe1fa1808fed490257f49.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;377c4058cab05fdcb387510b046cfe810b3bc1cf.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;d71d60d522c2dbeb16aca26cf09b1a66af74ec80.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;a5dfe12768c88fdfeca146ba935b721b73498388.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;4ec60c3a41a2d497f6a8026084b00436cd279ccd.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;13242db685a8be73ff4edb6f17e25c6887151d9d.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;1c2351c9729cfcfb0731cb3fc99fb59aaaa35d8c.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;53f769eb1608011ec9c443d52872e68935eb75e2.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;abb09f452669d760be66ff3436e433b90b650f1e.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;95fd8436dbbb75d2fd5b248ee5334a849656f447.jpg\&quot;,null,\&quot;9caa59d7890b50bef2dc550bba5b1bbf2f3f8288.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;ba31422b3bb16dcf389bad1ee6be225a11e41860.jpg\&quot;,\&quot;d622207376b990921bf89cf1918621801ae42751.jpg\&quot;,null,\&quot;f3df2c4e9a32204caff906ce87d8222ae3439596.jpg\&quot;,null],\&quot;bSaleEnabled\&quot;:true,\&quot;sale_show_creator\&quot;:false,\&quot;sale_sections\&quot;:[{\&quot;capsules\&quot;:[],\&quot;events\&quot;:[],\&quot;links\&quot;:[],\&quot;localized_label\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;localized_label_image\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;default_label\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;section_type\&quot;:\&quot;text_section\&quot;,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:65931,\&quot;background_gradient_bottom\&quot;:\&quot;rgba(28, 24, 23, 0.77)\&quot;,\&quot;background_gradient_top\&quot;:\&quot;rgba(28, 24, 23, 0.74)\&quot;,\&quot;internal_section_data\&quot;:null,\&quot;text_section_contents\&quot;:[\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Welcome to the Press Preview[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]This sneak peek at the Steam Next Fest October 2026 lineup of participants and events is designed to help you discover new upcoming games that you're excited to share with your audience.\\n\\nWhat you see here is the list of expected participating games*; each plan to have a free demo available for players starting October 19 to October 26, 2026 @  10:00AM Pacific. Some of the games already have a playable demo for you to check out if you so wish (you can search for those available now by clicking on the 'playable demos' tab). Then access the demo by clicking the 'install demo' button that appears when hovering over any game in this Fest.\\n\\nThis preview is not subject to any embargo and you may share your impressions with your audience any time. [b]However, please do not share this preview URL. This page is for press only.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Press Kit Download[\\\/h3]\\nGet the [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam Next Fest Press Kit[\\\/url] on Dropbox. Includes:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Official Trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Graphics &amp; logos[\\\/b] - for artwork and logos to accompany your articles or videos.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Official event page[\\\/h3]\\nHere is the URL for the official event page: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nPlease let us know if you have any questions.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Full list of participating games is subject to change up until launch of Next Fest\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Willkommen zur Pressevorschau[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Diese Vorschau auf die Teilnehmer und Events der Steam-Spielevorschau im Oktober 2026 hilft Ihnen dabei, in K\\u00fcrze erscheinende Spiele zu entdecken, f\\u00fcr die sich Ihr Publikum interessieren k\\u00f6nnte.\\n\\nHier ist eine Liste der voraussichtlich teilnehmenden Spiele*. Alle aufgef\\u00fchrten Spiele planen, mit einer kostenlosen Demo teilzunehmen, die Spieler vom 19. Oktober um 19 Uhr MESZ bis zum 26. Oktober um 18 Uhr MEZ ausprobieren k\\u00f6nnen. Einige Titel bieten bereits eine spielbare Demo an, die Sie auf Wunsch ausprobieren k\\u00f6nnen. Klicken Sie dazu einfach auf den Tab \\u201eSpielbare Demos\\u201c, fahren Sie mit Ihrer Maus \\u00fcber ein beliebiges Spiel und klicken Sie auf \\u201eDemo installieren\\u201c.\\n\\nDie Presseberichterstattung f\\u00fcr diese Vorschau unterliegt keiner Geheimhaltung. Sie k\\u00f6nnen Ihre Eindr\\u00fccke jederzeit mit Ihrem Publikum teilen\\u00a0\\u2013 [b]mit Ausnahme dieser Vorschau-URL. Diese Webseite ist nur f\\u00fcr Mitglieder der Presse bestimmt.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Pressekit herunterladen[\\\/h3]\\nLaden Sie das [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Pressekit f\\u00fcr die Steam-Spielevorschau[\\\/url] von Dropbox herunter. Inhalt:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Offizieller Trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafiken und Logos[\\\/b] f\\u00fcr Ihre Artikel und Videos\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Offizielle Eventseite[\\\/h3]\\nDies ist die URL f\\u00fcr das Event: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nBei Fragen nehmen Sie bitte mit uns Kontakt auf.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Die Liste der teilnehmenden Spiele kann sich bis zum Beginn der Spielevorschau noch \\u00e4ndern.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Bienvenue \\u00e0 l'avant-premi\\u00e8re pour la presse[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]En levant le voile sur les \\u00e9quipes participantes et les \\u00e9v\\u00e8nements de l'\\u00e9dition d'octobre\\u00a02026 de N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest, nous souhaitons vous faire d\\u00e9couvrir les titres \\u00e0 venir que vous aurez h\\u00e2te de faire connaitre \\u00e0 votre public.\\n\\nVoici la liste des jeux qui pr\\u00e9voient de participer \\u00e0 l'\\u00e9v\\u00e8nement*. Tous proposeront une d\\u00e9mo gratuite, disponible lors du festival qui se d\\u00e9roulera du 19\\u00a0octobre \\u00e0 19\\u00a0h (UTC+2) au 26\\u00a0octobre\\u00a02026 \\u00e0 18\\u00a0h (UTC+1). Certaines d\\u00e9mos sont d'ores et d\\u00e9j\\u00e0 disponibles si vous souhaitez y jeter un \\u0153il (cliquez sur l'onglet \\u00ab\\u00a0D\\u00e9mos jouables\\u00a0\\u00bb pour les parcourir). Il suffit ensuite de cliquer sur le bouton \\u00ab\\u00a0Installer la d\\u00e9mo\\u00a0\\u00bb qui apparait lorsque vous survolez un jeu du festival avec votre souris.\\n\\nAucune condition de confidentialit\\u00e9 n'est impos\\u00e9e pour cette avant-premi\\u00e8re et vous pouvez partager vos impressions avec votre public quand bon vous semble. [b]Cependant, merci de ne pas en partager l'URL. Cette page est r\\u00e9serv\\u00e9e \\u00e0 la presse.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]T\\u00e9l\\u00e9chargement du kit de ressources pour la presse[\\\/h3]\\nT\\u00e9l\\u00e9chargez le kit de [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]l'avant-premi\\u00e8re de Steam\\u00a0N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest pour la presse[\\\/url] sur Dropbox. Il comprend\\u00a0:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]la bande-annonce officielle[\\\/b]\\u00a0; \\n[*][b]des ressources graphiques et logos[\\\/b] pour accompagner vos articles et vid\\u00e9os.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Page officielle de l'\\u00e9v\\u00e8nement[\\\/h3]\\nVoici l'URL de la page officielle de l'\\u00e9v\\u00e8nement\\u00a0: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url].\\n\\nN'h\\u00e9sitez pas \\u00e0 nous contacter si vous avez des questions.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n*\\u00a0La liste compl\\u00e8te des jeux participants est susceptible d'\\u00eatre modifi\\u00e9e d'ici au d\\u00e9but de N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Ti diamo il benvenuto all'anteprima per la stampa.[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Questa anteprima degli eventi e dei partecipanti al Next Fest di Steam di ottobre 2026 \\u00e8 pensata per aiutarti a scoprire i nuovi giochi in arrivo che non vedi l'ora di condividere con il tuo pubblico.\\n\\nQuella che vedi qui \\u00e8 la lista completa dei giochi*, tutti previsti con una demo gratuita disponibile, che parteciperanno al festival dal 19 ottobre alle 19:00 al 26 ottobre 2026 alle 18:00. Alcuni titoli hanno gi\\u00e0 una demo giocabile che puoi provare, se lo desideri. Puoi cercare quelle disponibili ora cliccando sulla scheda \\\&quot;Demo giocabili\\\&quot;. \\u00c8 possibile accedere alla demo cliccando sul tasto \\\&quot;Installa demo\\\&quot; che compare quando passi con il mouse su qualunque gioco che partecipa al festival.\\n\\nQuesta anteprima non \\u00e8 soggetta ad alcun embargo e puoi condividere le tue opinioni con il pubblico in qualunque momento. [b]Ad ogni modo, non condividere questo URL dell'anteprima. Questa pagina \\u00e8 riservata alla stampa.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Download del kit per la stampa[\\\/h3]\\nScarica il [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Kit per la stampa del Next Fest di Steam[\\\/url] da Dropbox. Include:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Trailer ufficiale[\\\/b]. \\n[*][b]Immagini e loghi[\\\/b] da allegare ai tuoi articoli o video.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Pagina ufficiale dell'evento[\\\/h3]\\nEcco l'URL della pagina ufficiale dell'evento: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url].\\n\\nFacci sapere se hai delle domande.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* La lista completa dei giochi partecipanti \\u00e8 soggetta a modifiche prima dell'inizio del Next Fest.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]\\uc5b8\\ub860 \\uc2dc\\uc0ac\\ud68c\\uc5d0 \\uc624\\uc2e0 \\uac83\\uc744 \\ud658\\uc601\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\uadc0\\uc0ac\\uc758 \\uc2dc\\uccad\\uc790 \\ub610\\ub294 \\ub3c5\\uc790\\uc5d0\\uac8c \\uc18c\\uac1c\\ud560 \\ub9cc\\ud55c \\uc2e0\\uaddc \\ucd9c\\uc2dc \\uc608\\uc815 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ubc1c\\uacac\\ud558\\ub294 \\ub370 \\ub3c4\\uc6c0\\uc744 \\ub4dc\\ub9ac\\uae30 \\uc704\\ud574 \\uc774\\ubc88 2026\\ub144 10\\uc6d4 Steam Next Fest \\ucc38\\uac00 \\uac1c\\ubc1c\\uc0ac \\ub77c\\uc778\\uc5c5 \\ubc0f \\uc774\\ubca4\\ud2b8\\ub97c \\uc0b4\\uc9dd \\ubbf8\\ub9ac \\ubcf4\\uc5ec\\ub4dc\\ub9bd\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n\\uc774\\ubca4\\ud2b8 \\ucc38\\uac00\\uac00 \\uc608\\uc0c1\\ub418\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ubaa9\\ub85d*\\uc744 \\uc774 \\ud398\\uc774\\uc9c0\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud655\\uc778\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc73c\\uba70, \\uac01 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc740 \\ud0dc\\ud3c9\\uc591 \\ud45c\\uc900\\uc2dc \\uae30\\uc900 2026\\ub144 10\\uc6d4 19\\uc77c \\uc624\\uc804 10\\uc2dc\\ubd80\\ud130 10\\uc6d4 26\\uc77c \\uc624\\uc804 10\\uc2dc\\uae4c\\uc9c0 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\uc5b4\\ub97c \\uc704\\ud55c \\ubb34\\ub8cc \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310\\uc744 \\uacf5\\uac1c\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc77c\\ubd80 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc758 \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310\\uc740 \\uc774\\ubbf8 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774 \\uac00\\ub2a5\\ud558\\ubbc0\\ub85c \\uc5b8\\uc81c\\ub4e0\\uc9c0 \\ud655\\uc778\\ud574 \\ubcfc \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4('\\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774 \\uac00\\ub2a5\\ud55c \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310' \\ud0ed\\uc744 \\ud074\\ub9ad\\ud558\\uc5ec \\uc9c0\\uae08 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uac80\\uc0c9 \\uac00\\ub2a5). \\uc774\\ubca4\\ud2b8\\uc5d0 \\ucc38\\uac00\\ud558\\ub294 \\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc5d0 \\ub9c8\\uc6b0\\uc2a4\\ub97c \\uc62c\\ub9ac\\uba74 \\ud45c\\uc2dc\\ub418\\ub294 '\\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310 \\uc124\\uce58' \\ubc84\\ud2bc\\uc744 \\ud074\\ub9ad\\ud558\\uc5ec \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310\\uc744 \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n\\uc774\\ubc88 \\uc2dc\\uc0ac\\ud68c\\ub294 \\uc5e0\\ubc14\\uace0 \\ub300\\uc0c1\\uc774 \\uc544\\ub2c8\\ubbc0\\ub85c \\uc5b8\\uc81c\\ub4e0\\uc9c0 \\uc5ec\\ub7ec\\ubd84\\uaed8\\uc11c \\ubc1b\\uc740 \\uc778\\uc0c1\\uacfc \\ub290\\ub08c\\uc744 \\uc2dc\\uccad\\uc790 \\ub610\\ub294 \\ub3c5\\uc790\\uc5d0\\uac8c \\uc790\\uc720\\ub86d\\uac8c \\uc804\\ub2ec\\ud558\\uc2e4 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. [b]\\uadf8\\ub7ec\\ub098 \\uc2dc\\uc0ac\\ud68c URL\\uc740 \\uc678\\ubd80\\uc640 \\uacf5\\uc720\\ud558\\uc9c0 \\ub9d0\\uc544 \\uc8fc\\uc2dc\\uae30 \\ubc14\\ub78d\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc774 \\ud398\\uc774\\uc9c0\\ub294 \\uc5b8\\ub860\\uc0ac \\uc804\\uc6a9\\uc785\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]\\uc5b8\\ub860\\uc0ac \\uc790\\ub8cc \\ub2e4\\uc6b4\\ub85c\\ub4dc[\\\/h3]\\nDropbox\\uc5d0\\uc11c [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam Next Fest \\uc5b8\\ub860\\uc0ac \\uc790\\ub8cc[\\\/url]\\ub97c \\ub2e4\\uc6b4\\ub85c\\ub4dc\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694. \\ub2e4\\uc74c \\uc790\\ub8cc\\uac00 \\ud3ec\\ud568\\ub418\\uc5b4 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n[list]\\n[*][b]\\uacf5\\uc2dd \\uc608\\uace0\\ud3b8[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]\\uadf8\\ub798\\ud53d \\ubc0f \\ub85c\\uace0[\\\/b] - \\uae30\\uc0ac \\uae00 \\ub610\\ub294 \\uc601\\uc0c1\\uc5d0 \\ucca8\\ubd80\\ud560 \\uc544\\ud2b8\\uc6cc\\ud06c \\ubc0f \\ub85c\\uace0\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]\\uacf5\\uc2dd \\uc774\\ubca4\\ud2b8 \\ud398\\uc774\\uc9c0[\\\/h3]\\n\\uacf5\\uc2dd \\uc774\\ubca4\\ud2b8 \\ud398\\uc774\\uc9c0 URL: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\n\\uad81\\uae08\\ud55c \\uc810\\uc774 \\uc788\\uc73c\\uc2dc\\uba74 \\uc5b8\\uc81c\\ub4e0\\uc9c0 \\ubb38\\uc758\\ud574 \\uc8fc\\uc138\\uc694.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* \\ucc38\\uac00 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uc804\\uccb4 \\ubaa9\\ub85d\\uc740 Steam Next Fest \\uc2dc\\uc791 \\uc804\\uae4c\\uc9c0 \\ubcc0\\uacbd\\ub420 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Te damos la bienvenida al avance para la prensa[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Este anticipo del conjunto de participantes y eventos del Next\\u00a0Fest de Steam de octubre de 2026 est\\u00e1 dise\\u00f1ado para ayudarte a descubrir pr\\u00f3ximos lanzamientos que te encantar\\u00e1 compartir con tu audiencia.\\n\\nEsta lista incluye los juegos que tienen previsto participar*, y todos ellos tendr\\u00e1n demos gratuitas disponibles para los jugadores del 19 de octubre de 2026 a las 19:00 (hora peninsular) al 26 de octubre a las 18:00. Algunos de los juegos ya tienen demos disponibles que puedes probar si quieres (para encontrarlas, haz clic en la pesta\\u00f1a \\u00abDemos\\u00a0jugables\\u00bb). Despu\\u00e9s, para acceder a la demo, haz clic en el bot\\u00f3n \\u00abInstalar demo\\u00bb que aparecer\\u00e1 cuando pases el cursor sobre cualquier juego de este festival.\\n\\nEste adelanto no est\\u00e1 sujeto a ninguna prohibici\\u00f3n y puedes compartir tus impresiones con tu audiencia en cualquier momento. [b]Sin embargo, te rogamos que no compartas el URL del avance. Esta p\\u00e1gina es solo para la prensa.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Descarga del kit de prensa[\\\/h3]\\nDescarga el [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]kit de prensa del Next\\u00a0Fest de Steam[\\\/url] en Dropbox. Incluye:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Tr\\u00e1iler oficial[\\\/b]. \\n[*][b]Gr\\u00e1ficos y logos[\\\/b] para las ilustraciones y logotipos que acompa\\u00f1en a tus art\\u00edculos o v\\u00eddeos.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]P\\u00e1gina oficial del evento[\\\/h3]\\nEste es el URL de la p\\u00e1gina oficial del evento: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url].\\n\\nPor favor, ponte en contacto con nosotros si tienes dudas.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* La lista completa de juegos participantes puede cambiar hasta que comience el Next\\u00a0Fest.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]\\u6b22\\u8fce\\u6765\\u5230\\u5a92\\u4f53\\u9884\\u73a9[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\u5a92\\u4f53\\u9884\\u73a9\\u8ba9\\u5404\\u4f4d\\u62a2\\u5148\\u4e00\\u77a5\\u53c2\\u52a0 Steam \\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282 2026 \\u5e74 10 \\u6708\\u7248\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u548c\\u5728\\u6b64\\u671f\\u95f4\\u5c06\\u4e3e\\u529e\\u7684\\u6d3b\\u52a8\\uff0c\\u8ba9\\u5404\\u4f4d\\u53d1\\u73b0\\u5fcd\\u4e0d\\u4f4f\\u60f3\\u548c\\u53d7\\u4f17\\u5206\\u4eab\\u7684\\u5373\\u5c06\\u63a8\\u51fa\\u7684\\u65b0\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5404\\u4f4d\\u5c06\\u5728\\u5a92\\u4f53\\u9884\\u73a9\\u4e2d\\u770b\\u5230\\u9884\\u8ba1\\u53c2\\u52a0\\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u7684\\u5217\\u8868*\\uff0c\\u6bcf\\u6b3e\\u6e38\\u620f\\u90fd\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u4ece 2026 \\u5e74 10 \\u6708 19 \\u65e5\\u81f3 10 \\u6708 26 \\u65e5\\u4e0a\\u5348 10 \\u65f6\\uff08PT\\uff09\\u4e3a\\u73a9\\u5bb6\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u514d\\u8d39\\u8bd5\\u7528\\u7248\\u3002\\u5176\\u4e2d\\u4e00\\u4e9b\\u6e38\\u620f\\u5df2\\u7ecf\\u4e3a\\u5404\\u4f4d\\u51c6\\u5907\\u4e86\\u53ef\\u73a9\\u7684\\u8bd5\\u7528\\u7248\\uff0c\\u613f\\u610f\\u7684\\u8bdd\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5c1d\\u8bd5\\u4e00\\u756a\\uff08\\u70b9\\u51fb\\u201c\\u53ef\\u73a9\\u8bd5\\u7528\\u7248\\u201d\\u9009\\u9879\\u5361\\uff0c\\u5373\\u53ef\\u627e\\u5230\\u5f53\\u524d\\u5