002\\u4f53\\u9a13\\u7248\\u306b\\u30a2\\u30af\\u30bb\\u30b9\\u3059\\u308b\\u306b\\u306f\\u3001\\u3053\\u306e\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30b9\\u306e\\u53c2\\u52a0\\u30b2\\u30fc\\u30e0\\u306b\\u30ab\\u30fc\\u30bd\\u30eb\\u3092\\u5408\\u308f\\u305b\\u308b\\u3068\\u8868\\u793a\\u3055\\u308c\\u308b\\u300c\\u4f53\\u9a13\\u7248\\u3092\\u30a4\\u30f3\\u30b9\\u30c8\\u30fc\\u30eb\\u300d\\u30dc\\u30bf\\u30f3\\u3092\\u30af\\u30ea\\u30c3\\u30af\\u3057\\u307e\\u3059\\u3002\\n\\n\\u3053\\u306e\\u30d7\\u30ec\\u30d3\\u30e5\\u30fc\\u306f\\u516c\\u958b\\u7981\\u6b62\\u306e\\u5bfe\\u8c61\\u3067\\u306f\\u3042\\u308a\\u307e\\u305b\\u3093\\u306e\\u3067\\u3001\\u3044\\u3064\\u3067\\u3082\\u30aa\\u30fc\\u30c7\\u30a3\\u30a8\\u30f3\\u30b9\\u3068\\u611f\\u60f3\\u3092\\u5171\\u6709\\u3057\\u3066\\u3044\\u305f\\u3060\\u3044\\u3066\\u69cb\\u3044\\u307e\\u305b\\u3093\\u3002 [b]\\u305f\\u3060\\u3057\\u3001\\u3053\\u306e\\u30d7\\u30ec\\u30d3\\u30e5\\u30fc\\u306eURL\\u306f\\u5171\\u6709\\u3057\\u306a\\u3044\\u3067\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\u3053\\u306e\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8\\u306f\\u30d7\\u30ec\\u30b9\\u95a2\\u4fc2\\u8005\\u5c02\\u7528\\u3067\\u3059\\u3002[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]\\u30d7\\u30ec\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30c3\\u30c8\\u306e\\u30c0\\u30a6\\u30f3\\u30ed\\u30fc\\u30c9[\\\/h3]\\nDropbox\\u304b\\u3089[url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam Next\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30b9\\u30d7\\u30ec\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30c3\\u30c8[\\\/url]\\u3092\\u30c0\\u30a6\\u30f3\\u30ed\\u30fc\\u30c9\\u3057\\u3066\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\u30ad\\u30c3\\u30c8\\u306e\\u5185\\u5bb9\\u306f\\u4ee5\\u4e0b\\u306e\\u3068\\u304a\\u308a\\u3067\\u3059\\u3002\\n[list]\\n[*][b]\\u516c\\u5f0f\\u4e88\\u544a\\u7de8[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]\\u30b0\\u30e9\\u30d5\\u30a3\\u30c3\\u30af\\u3068\\u30ed\\u30b4[\\\/b]\\uff0d\\u8a18\\u4e8b\\u3084\\u52d5\\u753b\\u306b\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u3067\\u304d\\u308b\\u30a2\\u30fc\\u30c8\\u30ef\\u30fc\\u30af\\u3084\\u30ed\\u30b4\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]\\u516c\\u5f0f\\u30a4\\u30d9\\u30f3\\u30c8\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8[\\\/h3]\\n\\u516c\\u5f0f\\u30a4\\u30d9\\u30f3\\u30c8\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8\\u306eURL\\u306f\\u3053\\u3061\\u3089\\u3067\\u3059\\uff1a[url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\n\\u3054\\u8cea\\u554f\\u304c\\u3042\\u308c\\u3070\\u3001\\u304a\\u554f\\u3044\\u5408\\u308f\\u305b\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n*\\u53c2\\u52a0\\u30b2\\u30fc\\u30e0\\u306e\\u4e00\\u89a7\\u306f\\u3001Next\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30b9\\u306e\\u958b\\u59cb\\u307e\\u3067\\u306b\\u5909\\u66f4\\u3055\\u308c\\u308b\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u6027\\u304c\\u3042\\u308a\\u307e\\u3059\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Damos\\u2011lhe as boas\\u2011vindas \\u00e0 antevis\\u00e3o para a imprensa[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Esta vis\\u00e3o pr\\u00e9via dos participantes e eventos da edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de outubro de 2026 do Steam Next Fest foi pensada para ajudar na descoberta de lan\\u00e7amentos futuros que poder\\u00e1 querer partilhar com o seu p\\u00fablico\\u2011alvo.\\n\\nEsta \\u00e9 a lista dos jogos participantes previstos*. Cada um planeia ter uma demo dispon\\u00edvel para os jogadores entre as 18h de 19 de outubro e as 17h de 26 de outubro de 2026 (hora de Lisboa). Alguns dos jogos j\\u00e1 t\\u00eam uma demo jog\\u00e1vel que pode experimentar, se quiser (pode clicar no separador \\\&quot;Demos jog\\u00e1veis\\\&quot; para procurar as demos dispon\\u00edveis). De seguida, basta clicar no bot\\u00e3o \\\&quot;instalar demo\\\&quot; que aparece ao passar o cursor por cima de qualquer jogo deste festival.\\n\\nEsta antevis\\u00e3o n\\u00e3o est\\u00e1 sujeita a nenhum embargo e por isso pode partilhar as suas opini\\u00f5es com o p\\u00fablico a qualquer altura. [b]Contudo, pedimos\\u2011lhe que n\\u00e3o partilhe o URL da antevis\\u00e3o. Esta p\\u00e1gina destina\\u2011se apenas \\u00e0 imprensa.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Download do kit para a imprensa[\\\/h3]\\nFa\\u00e7a o download do [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]kit do Steam Next Fest para a imprensa[\\\/url] na Dropbox. Inclui:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Trailer oficial[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Imagens e log\\u00f3tipos[\\\/b] \\u2013 Elementos gr\\u00e1ficos para acompanhar os seus artigos e v\\u00eddeos.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]P\\u00e1gina oficial do evento[\\\/h3]\\nAqui est\\u00e1 o URL da p\\u00e1gina oficial do evento: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nN\\u00e3o hesite em contactar\\u2011nos se tiver alguma d\\u00favida.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* A lista completa de jogos participantes est\\u00e1 sujeita a altera\\u00e7\\u00f5es at\\u00e9 ao in\\u00edcio do Steam Next Fest.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Witamy na pokazie prasowym[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Ta zapowied\\u017a spisu uczestnik\\u00f3w i wydarze\\u0144 Festiwalu Steam Next w pa\\u017adzierniku 2026 roku ma na celu pom\\u00f3c wam odkry\\u0107 nowe nadchodz\\u0105ce gry, o kt\\u00f3rych ch\\u0119tnie opowiecie swoim widzom, czytelnikom czy s\\u0142uchaczom.\\n\\nPrzed sob\\u0105 macie list\\u0119 spodziewanych gier bior\\u0105cych udzia\\u0142*. Dla ka\\u017cdej z nich zaplanowane jest darmowe demo, kt\\u00f3re zostanie udost\\u0119pnione graczom od 19 pa\\u017adziernika o 19:00 do 26 pa\\u017adziernika 2026 o 18:00 czasu polskiego. Niekt\\u00f3re gry ju\\u017c teraz oferuj\\u0105 grywalne dema, z kt\\u00f3rymi mo\\u017cecie si\\u0119 zapozna\\u0107, je\\u015bli chcecie (mo\\u017cecie wyszukiwa\\u0107 te dost\\u0119pne ju\\u017c teraz w sekcji \\u201eGrywalne dema\\u201d). Nast\\u0119pnie kliknijcie przycisk \\u201eZainstaluj demo\\u201d pojawiaj\\u0105cy si\\u0119 po najechaniu na dowoln\\u0105 gr\\u0119 bior\\u0105c\\u0105 udzia\\u0142.\\n\\nTen pokaz nie jest obj\\u0119ty \\u017cadnym embargiem. Mo\\u017cecie podzieli\\u0107 si\\u0119 swoimi wra\\u017ceniami w dowolnym momencie. [b]Prosimy jednak, by nie udost\\u0119pnia\\u0107 adresu URL tego pokazu. Ta strona jest przeznaczona wy\\u0142\\u0105cznie dla przedstawicieli prasy.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Pobierzcie zestaw prasowy[\\\/h3]\\nPobierzcie [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]zestaw prasowy Festiwalu Steam Next[\\\/url] z Dropboxa. Zawiera on:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Oficjalny zwiastun[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafiki i logo[\\\/b] \\u2013 do u\\u017cycia w waszych artyku\\u0142ach lub filmach.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Oficjalna strona wydarzenia[\\\/h3]\\nOto adres oficjalnej strony wydarzenia:\\n[url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nDajcie nam zna\\u0107, je\\u017celi macie jakie\\u015b pytania.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Pe\\u0142na lista gier bior\\u0105cych udzia\\u0142 mo\\u017ce ulec zmianie do momentu rozpocz\\u0119cia festiwalu.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Velkommen til presseeventet[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Dette smugkig p\\u00e5 deltagerne og begivenhederne i forfestivalen i oktober 2026 er designet til at hj\\u00e6lpe jer med at opdage nye kommende spil, I gerne vil dele med jeres m\\u00e5lgruppe.\\n\\nDette er listen over spil, som vi forventer vil deltage*. Hvert af dem planl\\u00e6gger at have en gratis demo, som vil v\\u00e6re tilg\\u00e6ngelig for spillere fra d. 19. oktober 2026 kl. 19 til d. 26. oktober 2026 kl. 18. Nogle af spillene har allerede en spilbar demo, som I kan pr\\u00f8ve, hvis I vil (I kan s\\u00f8ge efter tilg\\u00e6ngelige demoer nu ved at klikke p\\u00e5 fanen \\\&quot;Spilbare demoer\\\&quot;). Tilg\\u00e5 demoen ved at klikke p\\u00e5 knappen \\\&quot;Installer demo\\\&quot;, som vises, n\\u00e5r mark\\u00f8ren holdes over et spil i festivalen.\\n\\nDette event er ikke underlagt embargo, og I kan frit dele jeres indtryk med jeres m\\u00e5lgruppe n\\u00e5r som helst. [b]Men del venligst ikke denne forh\\u00e5ndsvisnings-URL. Denne side er kun til pressen.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Pressepakke[\\\/h3]\\nDownload [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]pressepakken til Steams forfestival[\\\/url] p\\u00e5 Dropbox. Indhold:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Officiel trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafik og logoer[\\\/b] \\u2013 til billeder og logoer til artikler eller videoer.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Officiel begivenhedsside[\\\/h3]\\nDette er URL'en til den officielle begivenhedsside: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nSig til, hvis I har nogen sp\\u00f8rgsm\\u00e5l.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Den komplette liste over deltagende spil er forbeholdt \\u00e6ndringer helt frem til forfestivalens begyndelse.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Welkom bij de perspresentatie[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Het doel van deze vooruitblik is om je een overzicht te geven van alle deelnemers en de evenementen die zijn gepland voor het Steam Next Festival van oktober 2026, zodat je nieuwe spellen kunt ontdekken die je wilt delen met je publiek.\\n\\nJe ziet hier de lijst van spellen waarvan deelname wordt verwacht*. Voor ieder spel is er een gratis demo gepland die spelers van 19 tot en met 26 oktober 2026 om 18 u. (UTC+1) kunnen uitproberen. Er zijn al enkele demo's beschikbaar als je nu al een kijkje wilt nemen. Dit doe je door op het tabblad 'Speelbare demo's' te klikken. Beweeg de muis vervolgens over een spel naar keuze en klik op 'Demo installeren'.\\n\\nEr geldt geen geheimhoudingsplicht voor dit overzicht en je kunt je indrukken op ieder gewenst moment met je publiek delen. [b]Deel de URL van de vooruitblik echter niet. Deze pagina is all\\u00e9\\u00e9n voor de pers bedoeld.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Perskit downloaden[\\\/h3]\\nDownload de [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]perskit voor het Steam Next Festival[\\\/url] op Dropbox. Inhoud:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]offici\\u00eble trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]grafische elementen en logo's[\\\/b]: beeldmateriaal en logo's die je kunt gebruiken voor je artikelen en video's.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Offici\\u00eble evenementpagina[\\\/h3]\\nDit is de URL voor de offici\\u00eble evenementpagina: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nLaat het ons weten als je vragen hebt.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* De volledige lijst van deelnemende spellen kan tot de start van het Next Festival worden gewijzigd.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Tervetuloa lehdist\\u00f6ennakkoon[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Lokakuun 2026 Steam Next Festin osallistujien ja tapahtumien ennakkokurkistus auttaa l\\u00f6yt\\u00e4m\\u00e4\\u00e4n uusia pelej\\u00e4, joista haluat kertoa yleis\\u00f6llesi.\\n\\nT\\u00e4\\u00e4lt\\u00e4 l\\u00f6yd\\u00e4t listan peleist\\u00e4, jotka aikovat osallistua ja tarjota ilmaisen demon, jota voi pelata 19.10.26 kello 20 alkaen Suomen aikaa. Joidenkin pelien demoja voi kokeilla jo nyt. Hae saatavilla olevia demoja klikkaamalla Pelattavat demot -v\\u00e4lilehte\\u00e4. Saat demon k\\u00e4ytt\\u00f6\\u00f6si klikkaamalla Asenna demo -painiketta, joka n\\u00e4kyy, kun pid\\u00e4t hiirt\\u00e4 mink\\u00e4 tahansa tapahtumaan osallistuvan pelin p\\u00e4\\u00e4ll\\u00e4.\\n\\nLehdist\\u00f6ennakkoon ei liity salassapitovelvollisuutta, joten voit vapaasti kertoa vaikutelmasi yleis\\u00f6lle milloin tahansa. [b]\\u00c4l\\u00e4 kuitenkaan jaa lehdist\\u00f6ennakon URL-osoitetta. Se on tarkoitettu vain lehdist\\u00f6lle.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Ladattava lehdist\\u00f6paketti[\\\/h3]\\nLataa [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam Next Fest -lehdist\\u00f6paketti[\\\/url] Dropboxista. Paketti sis\\u00e4lt\\u00e4\\u00e4\\n[list]\\n[*][b]virallisen trailerin[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]kuvia ja logoja[\\\/b] k\\u00e4ytett\\u00e4viksi artikkeleissa ja videoissa.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Virallinen tapahtumasivu[\\\/h3]\\nVirallinen tapahtumasivu l\\u00f6ytyy osoitteesta [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url].\\n\\nOta yhteytt\\u00e4, jos sinulla on kysytt\\u00e4v\\u00e4\\u00e4.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Lista Next Festiin osallistuvista peleist\\u00e4 saattaa muuttua ennen tapahtuman alkua.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Velkommen til pressevisningen[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Denne forh\\u00e5ndsvisningen av deltakerne og begivenhetene i Steams f\\u00f8rslippfestival i oktober 2026 er laget for \\u00e5 hjelpe deg med \\u00e5 oppdage kommende spill som du kan ha glede av \\u00e5 dele med publikum.\\n\\nDette er listen over spill vi forventer kommer til \\u00e5 delta* \\u2013 alle har planer om \\u00e5 ha en gratis demo tilgjengelig for spillere fra og med 19. oktober kl. 19 til 26. oktober 2026 kl. 18. Noen av spillene har allerede en spillbar demo du kan ta en titt p\\u00e5 hvis du vil (du kan ogs\\u00e5 s\\u00f8ke etter de som er tilgjengelige n\\u00e5 ved \\u00e5 trykke p\\u00e5 fanen for \\u00abspillbare demoer\\u00bb). F\\u00e5 tilgang til demoen ved \\u00e5 trykke p\\u00e5 \\u00abinstaller demo\\u00bb n\\u00e5r du holder over et spill i festivalen.\\n\\nDenne forh\\u00e5ndsvisningen er ikke taushetsbelagt, og du kan fritt dele inntrykkene dine med allmennheten n\\u00e5r som helst. [b]Men ikke del forh\\u00e5ndsvisningens nettadresse. Denne siden er kun for pressen.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Pressepakke[\\\/h3]\\nLast ned [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]pressepakken til Steams f\\u00f8rslippfestival[\\\/url] p\\u00e5 Dropbox. Innhold:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Offisiell trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafikk og logoer[\\\/b] \\u2013 til bilder og logoer i artikler eller videoer.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Offisiell side[\\\/h3]\\nHer er nettadressen til den offisielle siden:\\n[url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nTa gjerne kontakt om du har noen sp\\u00f8rsm\\u00e5l.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Listen over deltakende spill kan endre seg helt frem til begynnelsen p\\u00e5 f\\u00f8rslippfestivalen.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]V\\u00e4lkommen till f\\u00f6rhandstitten f\\u00f6r media[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Den h\\u00e4r tjuvtitten p\\u00e5 deltagarna och h\\u00e4ndelserna under oktoberutg\\u00e5van av f\\u00f6rfestivalen 2026 \\u00e4r utformad f\\u00f6r att hj\\u00e4lpa dig att hitta nya kommande spel som du vill dela med din m\\u00e5lgrupp.\\n\\nH\\u00e4r hittar du en lista \\u00f6ver spel som f\\u00f6rv\\u00e4ntas delta*. Alla deltagande spel har en gratis demo tillg\\u00e4nglig f\\u00f6r spelare fr\\u00e5n 19 oktober kl. 19.00 till 26 oktober kl. 18.00. N\\u00e5gra av spelen har redan sl\\u00e4ppt spelbara demor som du kan kolla in om du s\\u00e5 \\u00f6nskar. Klicka p\\u00e5 fliken Spelbara demor f\\u00f6r att se vilka som g\\u00e5r att spela just nu. F\\u00e5 tillg\\u00e5ng till demon genom att klicka p\\u00e5 knappen Installera demo, som man f\\u00e5r fram genom att hovra med musen \\u00f6ver spelen som deltar i festivalen.\\n\\nF\\u00f6rhandstitten \\u00e4r inte underlagd n\\u00e5got embargo, och du kan n\\u00e4r du vill dela dina intryck med din m\\u00e5lgrupp. [b]Men l\\u00e4nken till f\\u00f6rhandstitten b\\u00f6r inte delas d\\u00e5 sidan enbart \\u00e4r till f\\u00f6r media.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Mediapaket[\\\/h3]\\nH\\u00e4mta [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]mediapaketet till Steams f\\u00f6rfestival[\\\/url] p\\u00e5 Dropbox. Det inneh\\u00e5ller:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]officiell trailer[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]grafik och logotyper[\\\/b] \\u2013 f\\u00f6r bilder och logotyper till artiklar och videor.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Officiell eventsida[\\\/h3]\\nL\\u00e4nk till den officiella eventsidan: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nH\\u00f6r g\\u00e4rna av dig om du har n\\u00e5gra fr\\u00e5gor.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Den fullst\\u00e4ndiga listan \\u00f6ver deltagande spel kan komma att \\u00e4ndras innan f\\u00f6rfestivalen startar.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]\\u00dcdv a sajt\\u00f3betekint\\u00e9sben![\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Ez a 2026. okt\\u00f3beri Steam J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt r\\u00e9sztvev\\u0151it \\u00e9s esem\\u00e9nyeit bemutat\\u00f3 \\u00edzel\\u00edt\\u0151 arra lett tervezve, hogy seg\\u00edtsen felfedezned olyan \\u00faj, k\\u00f6zelg\\u0151 j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kokat, amelyeket izgatottan osztan\\u00e1l meg a k\\u00f6z\\u00f6ns\\u00e9geddel.\\n\\nAmit itt l\\u00e1tsz, az a v\\u00e1rhat\\u00f3an r\\u00e9szt vev\\u0151 j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kok* list\\u00e1ja, melyek mindegyik\\u00e9hez v\\u00e1rhat\\u00f3 egy ingyenes dem\\u00f3 is, amelyet a j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kosok okt\\u00f3ber 19. 19:00-t\\u00f3l (CEST) okt\\u00f3ber 26. 18:00-ig (CET) \\u00e9rhetnek el. N\\u00e9melyik j\\u00e1t\\u00e9knak m\\u00e1r van j\\u00e1tszhat\\u00f3 dem\\u00f3ja, amit ha szeretn\\u00e9l, kipr\\u00f3b\\u00e1lhatsz (a m\\u00e1r el\\u00e9rhet\\u0151 dem\\u00f3kra a \\u201eJ\\u00e1tszhat\\u00f3 dem\\u00f3k\\u201d f\\u00fclre kattintva kereshetsz r\\u00e1). Ezut\\u00e1n a dem\\u00f3t a \\u201eDem\\u00f3 telep\\u00edt\\u00e9se\\u201d gombra kattintva \\u00e9red el, ami e fesztiv\\u00e1l b\\u00e1rmelyik j\\u00e1t\\u00e9k\\u00e1ra r\\u00e1mutatva megjelenik.\\n\\nErre a betekint\\u00e9sre nem vonatkozik semmilyen tilalom, \\u00e9s b\\u00e1rmikor megoszthatod a benyom\\u00e1saidat a k\\u00f6z\\u00f6ns\\u00e9geddel. [b]Azonban k\\u00e9rj\\u00fck, ne oszd meg ezt a betekint\\u00e9si URL-t. Ez az oldal csak a sajt\\u00f3 sz\\u00e1m\\u00e1ra van.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Sajt\\u00f3csomag let\\u00f6lt\\u00e9se[\\\/h3]\\nT\\u00f6ltsd le a [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt sajt\\u00f3csomagot[\\\/url] a Dropboxb\\u00f3l. Tartalma:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Hivatalos el\\u0151zetes[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafik\\u00e1k \\u00e9s log\\u00f3k[\\\/b] \\u2013 a cikkeidhez vagy vide\\u00f3idhoz kapcsolhat\\u00f3 grafik\\u00e1k \\u00e9s log\\u00f3k.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Hivatalos esem\\u00e9nyoldal[\\\/h3]\\nItt van az URL a hivatalos esem\\u00e9nyoldalhoz: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url].\\n\\nK\\u00e9rj\\u00fck, jelezd, ha b\\u00e1rmilyen k\\u00e9rd\\u00e9sed van.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n*A r\\u00e9szt vev\\u0151 j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kok teljes list\\u00e1ja a J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt kezdet\\u00e9ig v\\u00e1ltozhat.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]V\\u00edtejte na n\\u00e1hledov\\u00e9 str\\u00e1nce pro m\\u00e9dia[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\u00da\\u010delem t\\u00e9to str\\u00e1nky je poskytnout V\\u00e1m seznam v\\u0161ech \\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u00edk\\u016f a ud\\u00e1lost\\u00ed napl\\u00e1novan\\u00fdch na festival Steam Next (\\u0159\\u00edjen 2026), abyste mohli objevit nadch\\u00e1zej\\u00edc\\u00ed hry a pod\\u011blit se o n\\u011b se sv\\u00fdm publikem.\\n\\nTo, co vid\\u00edte zde, je kompletn\\u00ed seznam pravd\\u011bpodobn\\u011b z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fdch her*, z nich\\u017e ka\\u017ed\\u00e1 pl\\u00e1nuje od 19. \\u0159\\u00edjna 19.00 do 26. \\u0159\\u00edjna 18.00 nab\\u00edzet bezplatnou demoverzi. N\\u011bkter\\u00e9 nab\\u00edz\\u00ed demoverzi u\\u017e nyn\\u00ed, tak\\u017ee nev\\u00e1hejte a zkou\\u0161ejte \\u2013 aktu\\u00e1ln\\u011b dostupn\\u00e9 demoverze najdete v sekci \\u201eHrateln\\u00e9 demoverze\\u201c a potom u\\u017e jenom sta\\u010d\\u00ed najet my\\u0161\\u00ed na vybranou hru a kliknout na tla\\u010d\\u00edtko \\u201eNainstalovat demo\\u201c.\\n\\nNa tuto str\\u00e1nku se nevztahuje \\u017e\\u00e1dn\\u00e9 embargo a sv\\u00e9 dojmy m\\u016f\\u017eete sd\\u00edlet, kdykoli chcete. [b]Nesd\\u00edlejte v\\u0161ak URL adresu t\\u00e9to str\\u00e1nky, nebo\\u0165 je (a m\\u00e1 b\\u00fdt) dostupn\\u00e1 pouze m\\u00e9di\\u00edm.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Press kit[\\\/h3]\\nPress kit festivalu Steam Next si m\\u016f\\u017eete [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]st\\u00e1hnout zde (Dropbox)[\\\/url]. Co obsahuje:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Ofici\\u00e1ln\\u00ed upout\\u00e1vku[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Obr\\u00e1zky a loga[\\\/b] \\u2013 pokud byste cht\\u011bli doplnit sv\\u00e9 \\u010dl\\u00e1nky nebo videa ofici\\u00e1ln\\u00edmi prvky festivalu.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Ofici\\u00e1ln\\u00ed str\\u00e1nka festivalu[\\\/h3]\\nOfici\\u00e1ln\\u00ed str\\u00e1nka festivalu (kterou m\\u016f\\u017eete sd\\u00edlet): [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nM\\u00e1te-li jak\\u00fdkoli dotaz, dejte n\\u00e1m v\\u011bd\\u011bt.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Kompletn\\u00ed seznam z\\u00fa\\u010dastn\\u011bn\\u00fdch her se m\\u016f\\u017ee zm\\u011bnit a\\u017e do zah\\u00e1jen\\u00ed festivalu.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Bun-venit pe pagina de avanpremier\\u0103 destinat\\u0103 presei[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Aceast\\u0103 previzualizare a listei de participan\\u021bi \\u0219i a evenimentelor din cadrul Festivalului Steam Next din luna octombrie 2026 este conceput\\u0103 pentru a te ajuta s\\u0103 descoperi noile jocuri viitoare pe care dore\\u0219ti s\\u0103 le prezin\\u021bi publicului t\\u0103u.\\n\\nAceasta este lista cu jocurile care inten\\u021bioneaz\\u0103 s\\u0103 participe la festival*; fiecare joc va avea un demo gratuit disponibil pentru juc\\u0103tori \\u00eencep\\u00e2nd cu 19 octombrie 2026, ora 20:00 (UTC+3), p\\u00e2n\\u0103 pe 26 octombrie 2026 la ora 19:00 (UTC+2). Unele dintre titluri au deja un demo jucabil pe care \\u00eel po\\u021bi \\u00eencerca dac\\u0103 dore\\u0219ti (le po\\u021bi c\\u0103uta pe cele disponibile acum acces\\u00e2nd fila \\u201eDemouri jucabile\\u201d). Apoi acceseaz\\u0103 demoul ap\\u0103s\\u00e2nd butonul \\u201eInstaleaz\\u0103 versiunea demo\\u201d care apare atunci c\\u00e2nd treci cu mouse-ul peste orice joc din cadrul acestui festival.\\n\\nAceast\\u0103 avanpremier\\u0103 nu este supus\\u0103 niciunei restric\\u021bii de mediatizare \\u0219i po\\u021bi \\u00eemp\\u0103rt\\u0103\\u0219i oric\\u00e2nd cu publicul impresiile tale. [b]Cu toate acestea, te rug\\u0103m s\\u0103 nu distribui acest URL. Aceast\\u0103 pagin\\u0103 este numai pentru pres\\u0103.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Descarc\\u0103 kitul pentru pres\\u0103[\\\/h3]\\nOb\\u021bine [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]kitul pentru pres\\u0103 al Festivalului Steam Next[\\\/url] care este disponibil pe Dropbox. Acesta include:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Trailerul oficial[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Imagini \\u0219i logouri[\\\/b] \\u2013 pentru ilustra\\u021bii \\u0219i logouri care s\\u0103 fie incluse \\u00een articolele sau videoclipurile tale.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Pagina oficial\\u0103 a evenimentului[\\\/h3]\\nIat\\u0103 URL-ul pentru pagina oficial\\u0103 a evenimentului: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest?l=romanian]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nTe rug\\u0103m s\\u0103 ne comunici dac\\u0103 ai vreo \\u00eentrebare.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Lista complet\\u0103 a titlurilor participante poate suferi modific\\u0103ri \\u00eenainte de \\u00eenceperea Festivalului Steam Next.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Bas\\u0131n \\u00d6n \\u0130zlemesine Ho\\u015f Geldiniz[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steam Next Fest - Ekim 2026 kat\\u0131l\\u0131mc\\u0131lar\\u0131n\\u0131n ve etkinliklerinin yer ald\\u0131\\u011f\\u0131 bu \\u00f6n izleme, hayranlar\\u0131n\\u0131zla payla\\u015fmak i\\u00e7in heyecan duydu\\u011funuz, yak\\u0131n gelecekte \\u00e7\\u0131kacak olan oyunlar\\u0131n ke\\u015ffedilmesine yard\\u0131mc\\u0131 olmak i\\u00e7in tasarlanm\\u0131\\u015ft\\u0131r.\\n\\nBurada g\\u00f6rd\\u00fc\\u011f\\u00fcn\\u00fcz kat\\u0131lmas\\u0131 beklenen t\\u00fcm oyunlar\\u0131n bir listesidir* ve bu listede yer alan her oyun i\\u00e7in, oyuncular\\u0131n 19 Ekim 2026 TS\\u0130 20.00'den 26 Ekim ayn\\u0131 saate kadar oynayabilece\\u011fi \\u00fccretsiz bir demonun kullan\\u0131ma sunulmas\\u0131 planlanmaktad\\u0131r. Arzu ederseniz baz\\u0131 oyunlar\\u0131n h\\u00e2lihaz\\u0131rda oynanabilir demolar\\u0131n\\u0131 deneyebilirsiniz (\\\&quot;Oynanabilir Demolar\\\&quot; sekmesine t\\u0131klayarak mevcut oynanabilen oyunlar\\u0131 arayabilirsiniz). Bu festivale kat\\u0131lan herhangi bir oyunun \\u00fczerine imleci getirdi\\u011finizde \\u00e7\\u0131kan ''Demoyu Y\\u00fckle'' butonuna t\\u0131klayarak demoya eri\\u015febilirsiniz.\\n\\nBu \\u00f6n izlemeyi gizli tutman\\u0131z gibi bir gereklilik yoktur. \\u0130stedi\\u011finiz zaman izlenimlerinizi payla\\u015fabilirsiniz. [b]Ancak l\\u00fctfen bu \\u00f6n izleme ba\\u011flant\\u0131s\\u0131n\\u0131 payla\\u015fmay\\u0131n. Bu sayfa sadece bas\\u0131n i\\u00e7indir.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Bas\\u0131n Kitini \\u0130ndirin[\\\/h3]\\n[url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]Steam Next Fest bas\\u0131n kitini[\\\/url] Dropbox'tan indirebilirsiniz. \\u0130\\u00e7indekiler:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Resm\\u00ee Fragman[\\\/b] \\n[*][b]Grafikler ve Logolar[\\\/b] - Makalelerinize ve videolar\\u0131n\\u0131za e\\u015flik edecek \\u00e7izimler ve logolar.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]Resm\\u00ee etkinlik sayfas\\u0131[\\\/h3]\\nResm\\u00ee etkinlik sayfas\\u0131 ba\\u011flant\\u0131s\\u0131: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nBir sorunuz varsa l\\u00fctfen bizimle irtibata ge\\u00e7in.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* Kat\\u0131lan oyunlar\\u0131n tam listesi Next Fest ba\\u015flayana kadar de\\u011fi\\u015febilir.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Bem-vindos \\u00e0 pr\\u00e9via para a imprensa[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Esta pr\\u00e9via dos participantes e eventos da edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de outubro de 2026 do Steam Vem A\\u00ed foi projetada para ajudar voc\\u00ea a descobrir os futuros lan\\u00e7amentos que gostaria de compartilhar com o seu p\\u00fablico.\\n\\nO que voc\\u00ea v\\u00ea aqui \\u00e9 a lista provis\\u00f3ria dos jogos participantes* \\u2014 todos planejam disponibilizar uma demonstra\\u00e7\\u00e3o gratuita para os jogadores entre os dias 19 e 26 de outubro de 2026, \\u00e0s 14h (hor\\u00e1rio de Bras\\u00edlia). Alguns jogos j\\u00e1 t\\u00eam uma demonstra\\u00e7\\u00e3o jog\\u00e1vel, caso tenha interesse em experiment\\u00e1-la (voc\\u00ea pode ver a lista de demonstra\\u00e7\\u00f5es dispon\\u00edveis na aba \\\&quot;Demonstra\\u00e7\\u00f5es jog\\u00e1veis\\\&quot;). Para acessar a demonstra\\u00e7\\u00e3o, basta clicar no bot\\u00e3o \\\&quot;Instalar demonstra\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\\&quot; que aparece ao passar o mouse sobre qualquer jogo participante do festival.\\n\\nEsta pr\\u00e9via n\\u00e3o est\\u00e1 sujeita a nenhum embargo e voc\\u00ea pode compartilhar as suas impress\\u00f5es com o seu p\\u00fablico a qualquer momento. [b]Mas pedimos que n\\u00e3o compartilhe o URL da p\\u00e1gina de pr\\u00e9via. Ela \\u00e9 exclusiva para membros da imprensa.[\\\/b]\\n\\n[h3]Kit de imprensa[\\\/h3]\\nBaixe o [url=https:\\\/\\\/www.dropbox.com\\\/scl\\\/fo\\\/2llecwim2z8h33kx88bwj\\\/AMzgVzXaHcCBEZ2VT2meTNk?rlkey=4qypm77ktke6tbt4zfcedt6w1&amp;st=3kexhc54&amp;dl=0]kit de imprensa do Steam Vem A\\u00ed[\\\/url] no Dropbox. Inclui:\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Trailer oficial[\\\/b]. \\n[*][b]Gr\\u00e1ficos e logotipos[\\\/b]: artes e logotipos para acompanhar os seus artigos e v\\u00eddeos.\\n[\\\/list]\\n[h3]P\\u00e1gina oficial do evento[\\\/h3]\\nURL da p\\u00e1gina oficial do evento: [url=https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest]https:\\\/\\\/store.steampowered.com\\\/sale\\\/nextfest[\\\/url]\\n\\nEntre em contato conosco caso tenha alguma d\\u00favida.\\n\\n#SteamNextFest\\n\\n\\n* A lista completa de jogos participantes est\\u00e1 sujeita a altera\\u00e7\\u00f5es at\\u00e9 o in\\u00edcio do Steam Vem A\\u00ed.\\n[\\\/classname]\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]\\u0414\\u043e\\u0431\\u0440\\u0435 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0448\\u043b\\u0438 \\u0432 \\u201e\\u041f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0441\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430\\u201c[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\u0422\\u043e\\u0437\\u0438 \\u0431\\u044a\\u0440\\u0437 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u0440\\u0438\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0443\\u0447\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u043d\\u0438\\u0446\\u0438 \\u0438 \\u0441\\u044a\\u0431\\u0438\\u0442\\u0438\\u044f \\u0432 \\u201eSteam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u201c \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043e\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c\\u0432\\u0440\\u0438 2026 \\u0438\\u043c\\u0430 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0446\\u0435\\u043b \\u0434\\u0430 \\u0412\\u0438 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043c\\u043e\\u0433\\u043d\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u043e\\u0442\\u043a\\u0440\\u0438\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u0438 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438, \\u043a\\u043e\\u0438\\u0442\\u043e \\u0441 \\u0432\\u044a\\u043b\\u043d\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435 \\u0449\\u0435 \\u0441\\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0441 \\u0412\\u0430\\u0448\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0430\\u0443\\u0434\\u0438\\u0442\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u044f.\\n\\n\\u0422\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430, \\u043a\\u043e\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e \\u0432\\u0438\\u0436\\u0434\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0443\\u043a, \\u0435 \\u0441\\u043f\\u0438\\u0441\\u044a\\u043a\\u044a\\u0442 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043e\\u0447\\u0430\\u043a\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0443\\u0447\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u0432\\u0430\\u0449\\u0438 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438*, \\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e \\u0432\\u0441\\u044f\\u043a\\u0430 \\u043e\\u0442 \\u0442\\u044f\\u0445 \\u0441\\u0435 \\u043e\\u0447\\u0430\\u043a\\u0432\\u0430 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u0438\\u043c\\u0430 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u044a\\u043f\\u043d\\u043e \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0447\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0431\\u0435\\u0437\\u043f\\u043b\\u0430\\u0442\\u043d\\u043e \\u0434\\u0435\\u043c\\u043e \\u043e\\u0442 19 \\u0434\\u043e 26 \\u043e\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c\\u0432\\u0440\\u0438 \\u0432 20:00 \\u0447. \\u0431\\u044a\\u043b\\u0433\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e \\u0432\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435. \\u041d\\u044f\\u043a\\u043e\\u0438 \\u043e\\u0442 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0432\\u0435\\u0447\\u0435 \\u0438\\u043c\\u0430\\u0442 \\u0433\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u043e \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0443\\u0441\\u043a\\u0430\\u043d\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0435\\u043c\\u043e, \\u043a\\u043e\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e \\u043c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u0438\\u0437\\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0431\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435, \\u0430\\u043a\\u043e \\u0436\\u0435\\u043b\\u0430\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 (\\u043c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0442\\u044a\\u0440\\u0441\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0435\\u0437\\u0438, \\u043a\\u043e\\u0438\\u0442\\u043e \\u0432\\u0435\\u0447\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0430 \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u044a\\u043f\\u043d\\u0438, \\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u043e \\u043a\\u043b\\u0438\\u043a\\u043d\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0432\\u044a\\u0440\\u0445\\u0443 \\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0430 \\u201e\\u0413\\u043e\\u0434\\u043d\\u0438 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0443\\u0441\\u043a\\u0430\\u043d\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0435\\u043c\\u043e\\u0442\\u0430\\u201c). \\u0421\\u043b\\u