93a\\u3055\\u308c\\u308b\\u304b\\u3092\\u793a\\u3059\\u305f\\u3081\\u306e\\u3082\\u306e\\u3067\\u3059\\u3002 \\n\\n\\u3053\\u306e\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8\\u306e\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\u306f\\u6b21\\u306e\\u3068\\u304a\\u308a\\u3067\\u3059\\u3002\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]\\u30b2\\u30fc\\u30e0\\u306e\\u30ab\\u30c6\\u30b4\\u30ea\\u30fc\\u3092\\u78ba\\u8a8d[\\\/b]\\uff0d\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8\\u3092\\u898b\\u3066\\u56de\\u3063\\u3066\\u3001\\u30bf\\u30d6\\u3068\\u30ab\\u30c6\\u30b4\\u30ea\\u30fc\\u3092\\u78ba\\u8a8d\\u3057\\u3066\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\u88fd\\u54c1\\u306e\\u30b9\\u30c8\\u30a2\\u30da\\u30fc\\u30b8\\u306b\\u9069\\u7528\\u3055\\u308c\\u308b\\u30bf\\u30b0\\u3092\\u8abf\\u6574\\u3059\\u308b\\u3053\\u3068\\u3067\\u3001\\u7686\\u3055\\u3093\\u306e\\u30b2\\u30fc\\u30e0\\u306b\\u6700\\u3082\\u9069\\u3057\\u305f\\u30bb\\u30af\\u30b7\\u30e7\\u30f3\\u306b\\u8868\\u793a\\u3055\\u308c\\u308b\\u3088\\u3046\\u306b\\u306a\\u308a\\u307e\\u3059\\u3002 Next\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30b9\\u306b\\u5f79\\u7acb\\u3064\\u60c5\\u5831\\u306f[url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]\\u3053\\u3061\\u3089[\\\/url]\\u3092\\u3054\\u89a7\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\n[*][b]\\u8a73\\u7d30[\\\/b]\\uff0d\\u5168\\u8a73\\u7d30\\u306f[url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Steam Next\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30b9\\u306e\\u30c9\\u30ad\\u30e5\\u30e1\\u30f3\\u30c8[\\\/url]\\u3067\\u3054\\u78ba\\u8a8d\\u304f\\u3060\\u3055\\u3044\\u3002\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Antevis\\u00e3o para developers do Next Fest de outubro de 2026[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]O Steam Next Fest ir\\u00e1 decorrer entre as 18h de 19 de outubro e as 17h de 26 de outubro de 2026 (hora de Lisboa).\\n\\nEsta antevis\\u00e3o da p\\u00e1gina do Next Fest foi concebida para mostrar em que separadores e sec\\u00e7\\u00f5es o seu jogo vai aparecer. \\n\\nComo usar esta p\\u00e1gina:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Veja como o seu jogo est\\u00e1 categorizado[\\\/b] - Explore a p\\u00e1gina e veja os separadores e categorias. Pode ajustar os marcadores aplicados \\u00e0 p\\u00e1gina do seu jogo na loja para garantir que o mesmo apare\\u00e7a nas sec\\u00e7\\u00f5es mais adequadas. Para mais informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es, visite a [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]p\\u00e1gina de dicas para o Next Fest[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Mais detalhes[\\\/b] - [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Consulte a documenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o do Next Fest[\\\/url] para todos os detalhes.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Festiwal Steam Next \\u2013 przegl\\u0105d producent\\u00f3w w pa\\u017adzierniku 2026[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Festiwal Steam Next odb\\u0119dzie si\\u0119 od 19 pa\\u017adziernika o 19:00 do 26 pa\\u017adziernika 2026 roku o godzinie 18:00 czasu polskiego.\\n\\nTen podgl\\u0105d s\\u0142u\\u017cy przedstawieniu, w jakich zak\\u0142adkach i sekcjach pojawi si\\u0119 wasza gra. \\n\\nOto jak u\\u017cywa\\u0107 tej strony:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Zobacz, gdzie skategoryzowana jest twoja gra[\\\/b] \\u2013 przejrzyj ca\\u0142\\u0105 stron\\u0119 i sprawd\\u017a zak\\u0142adki oraz kategorie. Mo\\u017cesz dostosowa\\u0107 tagi przypisane do strony twojej gry w sklepie, by upewni\\u0107 si\\u0119, \\u017ce gra pojawi si\\u0119 w sekcjach, kt\\u00f3re najlepiej do niej pasuj\\u0105. Sprawd\\u017a tak\\u017ce [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]wskaz\\u00f3wki dotycz\\u0105ce Festiwalu Steam Next[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Wi\\u0119cej szczeg\\u00f3\\u0142\\u00f3w[\\\/b] \\u2013 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]zobacz dokumentacj\\u0119 Festiwalu Steam Next[\\\/url], by pozna\\u0107 wszystkie szczeg\\u00f3\\u0142y.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Forfestival oktober 2026 \\u2013 Udviklerforh\\u00e5ndsvisning[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steams forfestival afholdes fra d. 19. oktober 2026 kl. 19 til d. 26. oktober 2026 kl. 18.\\n\\nDenne forh\\u00e5ndsvisning af forfestivalsiden er designet til at vise, hvilke faner og sektioner jeres spil vil blive vist i. \\n\\nS\\u00e5dan bruges siden:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Se jeres spils kategorisering[\\\/b]: Udforsk siden og se fanerne og kategorierne. I kan justere, hvilke tags der bruges p\\u00e5 jeres butiksside, s\\u00e5 jeres spil vises i de sektioner, som giver mest mening for spillet. Tjek disse [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]tips til Steams forfestival[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Flere oplysninger[\\\/b]: [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Se dokumentationen om forfestivalen[\\\/url] for alle detaljer.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Next Festival van oktober 2026: vooruitblik voor ontwikkelaars[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Het Steam Next Festival vindt plaats van 19 tot 26 oktober 2026 om 18 u. (UTC+1).\\n\\nMet dit voorproefje van de festivalpagina kun je alvast zien op welke tabbladen en in welke secties je spel getoond zal worden. \\n\\nHoe gebruik je deze pagina?\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Kijk hoe je spel is gecategoriseerd:[\\\/b] verken de pagina en bekijk alle tabbladen en categorie\\u00ebn. Past je spel beter in een andere categorie? Je kunt de tags op de winkelpagina van je spel aanpassen om ervoor te zorgen dat je spel in de meest geschikte secties wordt weergegeven. Bekijk hier nog meer [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]tips voor het Next Festival[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Meer informatie:[\\\/b] zie onze [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]documentatie over het Next Festival[\\\/url].\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Lokakuun 2026 Next Fest \\u2013 kehitt\\u00e4j\\u00e4n esikatselu[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steam Next Fest alkaa 19.10. kello 20 ja jatkuu 26.10. kello 19 asti Suomen aikaa.\\n\\nNext Fest -sivun esikatselu n\\u00e4ytt\\u00e4\\u00e4, mill\\u00e4 v\\u00e4lilehdill\\u00e4 ja miss\\u00e4 osioissa pelisi tulee n\\u00e4kym\\u00e4\\u00e4n. \\n\\nSivu toimii seuraavasti.\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Pelin kategoria[\\\/b] \\u2013 Tarkista pelin kategoria ja v\\u00e4lilehdet, joilla se esiintyy. Voit muokata kauppasivullesi lis\\u00e4ttyj\\u00e4 tunnisteita varmistaaksesi, ett\\u00e4 pelisi n\\u00e4kyy sille parhaiten sopivissa osioissa. Lis\\u00e4\\u00e4 Next Fest -vinkkej\\u00e4 l\\u00f6ytyy [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]t\\u00e4\\u00e4lt\\u00e4[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Lis\\u00e4tietoja[\\\/b] \\u2013 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Steam Next Fest -dokumentaatiosta[\\\/url] l\\u00f6yd\\u00e4t kaikki tapahtumaan liittyv\\u00e4t tiedot.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]F\\u00f8rslippfestivalen oktober 2026 \\u2013 forh\\u00e5ndsvisning for utviklere[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steams f\\u00f8rslippfestival finner sted fra 19. oktober kl. 19 til 26. oktober 2026 kl. 18.\\n\\nDenne forh\\u00e5ndsvisningen av f\\u00f8rslippfestivalsiden viser hvilke faner og seksjoner spillet ditt kommer til \\u00e5 vises i. \\n\\nSlik bruker du denne siden:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Se hvordan spillet ditt er kategorisert[\\\/b] \\u2013 Utforsk denne siden og ta en titt p\\u00e5 fanene og kategoriene. Du kan justere merkelappene som brukes p\\u00e5 spillets butikkside, s\\u00e5 spillet vises i seksjonene som passer best. Ta en titt p\\u00e5 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]tips til f\\u00f8rslippfestivalen[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Mer informasjon[\\\/b] \\u2013 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]G\\u00e5 til dokumentasjonen om f\\u00f8rslippfestivalen[\\\/url] for fullstendige opplysninger.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]F\\u00f6rfestival, oktober 2026 \\u2013 f\\u00f6rhandstitt f\\u00f6r utvecklare[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steams f\\u00f6rfestival \\u00e4ger rum den 19\\u201326 oktober 2026, kl. 19.00.\\n\\nF\\u00f6rhandstitten p\\u00e5 f\\u00f6rfestivalen \\u00e4r utformad f\\u00f6r att visa under vilka flikar och sektioner ditt spel kommer att hamna. \\n\\nS\\u00e5 h\\u00e4r anv\\u00e4nder man sidan:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Hur har spelet kategoriserats?[\\\/b] Utforska sidan och se alla flikar och kategorier. Du kan justera taggarna som anv\\u00e4nds p\\u00e5 butikssidan f\\u00f6r att s\\u00e4kerst\\u00e4lla att spelet syns p\\u00e5 de b\\u00e4st l\\u00e4mpade platserna. Ta en titt p\\u00e5 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]tipsen inf\\u00f6r Steams f\\u00f6rfestival[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Mer information:[\\\/b] [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]L\\u00e4s dokumentationen om f\\u00f6rfestivalen[\\\/url] f\\u00f6r fullst\\u00e4ndig information.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt 2026. okt\\u00f3ber \\u2013 Fejleszt\\u0151i el\\u0151n\\u00e9zet[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]A Steam J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt 2026. okt\\u00f3ber 19. 19:00 (CEST) \\u00e9s okt\\u00f3ber 26. 18:00 (CET) k\\u00f6z\\u00f6tt ker\\u00fcl megrendez\\u00e9sre.\\n\\nA J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt ezen el\\u0151n\\u00e9zete azt hivatott megmutatni, mely f\\u00fcleken \\u00e9s szakaszokban fog megjelenni a j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kod. \\n\\n\\u00cdgy haszn\\u00e1ld ezt az oldalt:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]N\\u00e9zd meg, hova lett bekategoriz\\u00e1lva a j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kod[\\\/b] \\u2013 Fedezd fel itt az oldalt, hogy l\\u00e1sd a f\\u00fcleket \\u00e9s a kateg\\u00f3ri\\u00e1kat. Megv\\u00e1ltoztathatod az \\u00e1ruh\\u00e1zi oldaladra alkalmazott c\\u00edmk\\u00e9ket annak biztos\\u00edt\\u00e1s\\u00e1ra, hogy a j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kod a legmegfelel\\u0151bb szakaszokban bukkanjon fel. N\\u00e9zz meg n\\u00e9h\\u00e1ny [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt tippet[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Tov\\u00e1bbi r\\u00e9szletek[\\\/b] \\u2013 Az \\u00f6sszes r\\u00e9szlet\\u00e9rt [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]n\\u00e9zd meg a J\\u00f6v\\u0151 Feszt dokument\\u00e1ci\\u00f3t[\\\/url].\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Festival Steam Next (\\u0159\\u00edjen 2026) | n\\u00e1hledov\\u00e1 str\\u00e1nka pro v\\u00fdvoj\\u00e1\\u0159e[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Festival Steam Next prob\\u011bhne od 19. \\u0159\\u00edjna 19.00 do 26. \\u0159\\u00edjna 18.00.\\n\\nTato n\\u00e1hledov\\u00e1 str\\u00e1nka festivalu Steam Next slou\\u017e\\u00ed k uk\\u00e1zce toho, ve kter\\u00fdch z\\u00e1lo\\u017ek\\u00e1ch a sekc\\u00edch bude uvedena Va\\u0161e hra. \\n\\nK \\u010demu m\\u016f\\u017eete vyu\\u017e\\u00edt tuto str\\u00e1nku:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Zkontrolujte kategorizaci sv\\u00e9 hry[\\\/b] \\u2013 Projd\\u011bte si str\\u00e1nku a jej\\u00ed z\\u00e1lo\\u017eky a kategorie. Pokud svoji hru objev\\u00edte n\\u011bkde, kam se podle V\\u00e1s nehod\\u00ed, upravte jej\\u00ed zna\\u010dky v obchodu, aby byla na fin\\u00e1ln\\u00ed str\\u00e1nce festivalu kategorizov\\u00e1na l\\u00e9pe. Viz [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]Tipy pro festival Steam Next[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]P\\u0159e\\u010dt\\u011bte si kompletn\\u00ed informace[\\\/b] \\u2013 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Zde naleznete dokumentaci festivalu Steam Next[\\\/url].\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Festivalul Next, octombrie 2026 \\u2013 previzualizare pentru dezvoltatori[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Festivalul Steam Next va \\u00eencepe pe 19 octombrie 2026 la ora 20:00 (UTC+3) \\u0219i se va \\u00eencheia pe 26 octombrie 2026 la ora 19:00 (UTC+2).\\n\\nAceast\\u0103 previzualizare a paginii Festivalului Next are drept scop prezentarea filelor \\u0219i a sec\\u021biunilor \\u00een care va ap\\u0103rea titlul t\\u0103u. \\n\\nIat\\u0103 cum po\\u021bi utiliza aceast\\u0103 pagin\\u0103:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Verific\\u0103 \\u00een ce categorie este \\u00eencadrat jocul t\\u0103u[\\\/b] \\u2013 exploreaz\\u0103 pagina aici \\u0219i vezi filele \\u0219i categoriile. Po\\u021bi modifica etichetele aplicate paginii tale din magazin pentru a te asigura c\\u0103 titlul t\\u0103u este prezent \\u00een sec\\u021biunile cele mai relevante pentru acesta. Consult\\u0103 c\\u00e2teva [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips?l=romanian]sfaturi pentru Festivalul Next[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Mai multe detalii[\\\/b] \\u2013 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october?l=romanian]consult\\u0103 documenta\\u021bia cu privire la Festivalul Next[\\\/url] pentru detalii complete.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Next Fest: Ekim 2026 - Geli\\u015ftirici \\u00d6n \\u0130zlemesi[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]Steam Next Fest 19 Ekim 2026 TS\\u0130 20.00'de ba\\u015flayacak ve 26 Ekim'de ayn\\u0131 saatte sona erecek.\\n\\nNext Fest sayfas\\u0131n\\u0131n bu \\u00f6n izlemesi, oyununuzun hangi sekme ve b\\u00f6l\\u00fcmlerde g\\u00f6r\\u00fcnece\\u011fini g\\u00f6stermek i\\u00e7in tasarlanm\\u0131\\u015ft\\u0131r. \\n\\nBu sayfay\\u0131 \\u015funlar i\\u00e7in kullanabilirsiniz:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Oyununuzun Bulundu\\u011fu Kategorileri G\\u00f6rmek[\\\/b] - Bu sayfaya g\\u00f6z atarak sekmeleri ve kategorileri ke\\u015ffedin. Oyununuzun en uygun b\\u00f6l\\u00fcmlerde g\\u00f6sterilebilmesi i\\u00e7in gerekirse ma\\u011faza sayfan\\u0131za uygulanm\\u0131\\u015f etiketleri de\\u011fi\\u015ftirebilirsiniz. [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]Next Fest ipu\\u00e7lar\\u0131na[\\\/url] g\\u00f6z at\\u0131n.\\n[*][b]Ayr\\u0131nt\\u0131lar[\\\/b] - T\\u00fcm detaylar\\u0131 g\\u00f6rmek i\\u00e7in [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]Next Fest belgesini[\\\/url] ziyaret edin.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Steam Vem A\\u00ed, outubro de 2026: pr\\u00e9via para desenvolvedores[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]O Steam Vem A\\u00ed acontecer\\u00e1 de 19 a 26 de outubro de 2026, \\u00e0s 14h (hor\\u00e1rio de Bras\\u00edlia).\\n\\nEsta pr\\u00e9via da p\\u00e1gina do Steam Vem A\\u00ed serve para exibir em quais abas e se\\u00e7\\u00f5es o seu jogo aparecer\\u00e1. \\n\\nComo usar esta p\\u00e1gina:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]Confira a categoriza\\u00e7\\u00e3o do seu jogo[\\\/b] \\u2014 Explore a p\\u00e1gina e veja as abas e categorias. Voc\\u00ea pode ajustar os marcadores aplicados \\u00e0 p\\u00e1gina do seu jogo na loja para garantir que ele apare\\u00e7a nas se\\u00e7\\u00f5es apropriadas. Confira algumas [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]dicas do Steam Vem A\\u00ed[\\\/url].\\n[*][b]Mais detalhes[\\\/b] \\u2014 Consulte a [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]documenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o do Steam Vem A\\u00ed[\\\/url] para saber todos os detalhes.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]Steam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438 | \\u041f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0440\\u0430\\u0431\\u043e\\u0442\\u0447\\u0438\\u0446\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u2014 \\u043e\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c\\u0432\\u0440\\u0438 2026[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\u201eSteam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b\\u044a\\u0442 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u201c \\u0449\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0435 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0432\\u0435\\u0434\\u0435 \\u043e\\u0442 19 \\u0432 20:00 \\u0447. \\u0434\\u043e 26 \\u043e\\u043a\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c\\u0432\\u0440\\u0438 2026 \\u0432 19:00 \\u0447. \\u0431\\u044a\\u043b\\u0433\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u043e \\u0432\\u0440\\u0435\\u043c\\u0435.\\n\\n\\u0422\\u043e\\u0437\\u0438 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u0441\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0446\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u201eSteam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u201c \\u0438\\u043c\\u0430 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0446\\u0435\\u043b \\u0434\\u0430 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043a\\u0430\\u0436\\u0435 \\u0432 \\u043a\\u043e\\u0438 \\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0438 \\u0438 \\u0441\\u0435\\u043a\\u0446\\u0438\\u0438 \\u0449\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u044f\\u0432\\u0438 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0412\\u0438. \\n\\n\\u0415\\u0442\\u043e \\u043a\\u0430\\u043a \\u0434\\u0430 \\u0438\\u0437\\u043f\\u043e\\u043b\\u0437\\u0432\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0430\\u0437\\u0438 \\u0441\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0446\\u0430:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]\\u0412\\u0438\\u0436\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0432 \\u043a\\u043e\\u044f \\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u0433\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u044f \\u043f\\u043e\\u043f\\u0430\\u0434\\u0430 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0412\\u0438[\\\/b] \\u2014 \\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0443\\u0447\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0430\\u0437\\u0438 \\u0441\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0446\\u0430 \\u0438 \\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u0430\\u0439\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0440\\u0430\\u0437\\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435\\u0433\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435. \\u041c\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u043a\\u043e\\u0440\\u0438\\u0433\\u0438\\u0440\\u0430\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0442\\u0430\\u0433\\u043e\\u0432\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435, \\u043f\\u0440\\u0438\\u043b\\u043e\\u0436\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438 \\u043a\\u044a\\u043c \\u0412\\u0430\\u0448\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0441\\u0442\\u0440\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0446\\u0430 \\u0432 \\u043c\\u0430\\u0433\\u0430\\u0437\\u0438\\u043d\\u0430, \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0434\\u0430 \\u0441\\u0435 \\u0443\\u0432\\u0435\\u0440\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435, \\u0447\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0412\\u0438 \\u0441\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u043a\\u0430\\u0437\\u0432\\u0430 \\u0432 \\u0441\\u0435\\u043a\\u0446\\u0438\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435, \\u043a\\u043e\\u0438\\u0442\\u043e \\u0441\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0439-\\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0445\\u043e\\u0434\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0435\\u044f. \\u041f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0433\\u043b\\u0435\\u0434\\u0430\\u0439\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043d\\u044f\\u043a\\u043e\\u0438 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/tips]\\u0421\\u044a\\u0432\\u0435\\u0442\\u0438 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u201eSteam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u201c[\\\/url];\\n[*][b]\\u041e\\u0449\\u0435 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0440\\u043e\\u0431\\u043d\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438[\\\/b] \\u2014 [url=https:\\\/\\\/partner.steamgames.com\\\/doc\\\/marketing\\\/upcoming_events\\\/nextfest\\\/2026october]\\u0412\\u0438\\u0436\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0434\\u043e\\u043a\\u0443\\u043c\\u0435\\u043d\\u0442\\u0430\\u0446\\u0438\\u044f\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u201eSteam \\u0444\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0432\\u0430\\u043b\\u0430 \\u043d\\u0430 \\u043f\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e\\u044f\\u0449\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438\\u201c[\\\/url] \\u0437\\u0430 \\u043f\\u044a\\u043b\\u043d\\u0438 \\u043f\\u043e\\u0434\\u0440\\u043e\\u0431\\u043d\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438.\\n[\\\/list][\\\/classname][\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont][classname=EventDescTitle]\\u0393\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03c4\\u03ae \\u0395\\u03c0\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03c7\\u03cc\\u03bc\\u03b5\\u03bd\\u03c9\\u03bd | \\u039f\\u03ba\\u03c4\\u03ce\\u03b2\\u03c1\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c2 2026: \\u03a0\\u03c1\\u03bf\\u03b5\\u03c0\\u03b9\\u03c3\\u03ba\\u03cc\\u03c0\\u03b7\\u03c3\\u03b7 \\u03b4\\u03b7\\u03bc\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c5\\u03c1\\u03b3\\u03bf\\u03cd[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\u0397 \\u0393\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03c4\\u03ae \\u0395\\u03c0\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03c7\\u03cc\\u03bc\\u03b5\\u03bd\\u03c9\\u03bd Steam \\u03b8\\u03b1 \\u03c0\\u03c1\\u03b1\\u03b3\\u03bc\\u03b1\\u03c4\\u03bf\\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03b7\\u03b8\\u03b5\\u03af \\u03b1\\u03c0\\u03cc \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 19 \\u039f\\u03ba\\u03c4\\u03c9\\u03b2\\u03c1\\u03af\\u03bf\\u03c5, \\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 8 \\u03bc.\\u03bc. \\u03ce\\u03c1\\u03b1 \\u0395\\u03bb\\u03bb\\u03ac\\u03b4\\u03b1\\u03c2, \\u03ad\\u03c9\\u03c2 \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 26 \\u039f\\u03ba\\u03c4\\u03c9\\u03b2\\u03c1\\u03af\\u03bf\\u03c5 2026, \\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 7 \\u03bc.\\u03bc. \\u03ce\\u03c1\\u03b1 \\u0395\\u03bb\\u03bb\\u03ac\\u03b4\\u03b1\\u03c2.\\n\\n\\u0391\\u03c5\\u03c4\\u03ae \\u03b7 \\u03c0\\u03c1\\u03bf\\u03b5\\u03c0\\u03b9\\u03c3\\u03ba\\u03cc\\u03c0\\u03b7\\u03c3\\u03b7 \\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03c2 \\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03bb\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b1\\u03c2 \\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03c2 \\u0393\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03c4\\u03ae\\u03c2 \\u0395\\u03c0\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03c7\\u03cc\\u03bc\\u03b5\\u03bd\\u03c9\\u03bd \\u03b5\\u03af\\u03bd\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03c7\\u03b5\\u03b4\\u03b9\\u03b1\\u03c3\\u03bc\\u03ad\\u03bd\\u03b7 \\u03b3\\u03b9\\u03b1 \\u03bd\\u03b1 \\u03b4\\u03b5\\u03af\\u03c7\\u03bd\\u03b5\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03b5 \\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03c4\\u03ad\\u03bb\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03b5\\u03bd\\u03cc\\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03c4\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03b8\\u03b1 \\u03b5\\u03bc\\u03c6\\u03b1\\u03bd\\u03af\\u03b6\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03c4\\u03bf \\u03c0\\u03b1\\u03b9\\u03c7\\u03bd\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03b1\\u03c2. \\n\\n\\u03a0\\u03ce\\u03c2 \\u03bd\\u03b1 \\u03c7\\u03c1\\u03b7\\u03c3\\u03b9\\u03bc\\u03bf\\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03ae\\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03b1\\u03c5\\u03c4\\u03ae\\u03bd \\u03c4\\u03b7 \\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03bb\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b1:\\n\\n[list]\\n[*][b]\\u0394\\u03b5\\u03af\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03cd \\u03b5\\u03af\\u03bd\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03b3\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03b9\\u03bf\\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03b7\\u03bc\\u03ad\\u03bd\\u03bf \\u03c4\\u03bf \\u03c0\\u03b1\\u03b9\\u03c7\\u03bd\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03b1\\u03c2[\\\/b]. \\u0395\\u03be\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03b5\\u03c5\\u03bd\\u03ae\\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03c4\\u03b7 \\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03bb\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b1 \\u03b5\\u03b4\\u03ce \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03b4\\u03b5\\u03af\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03c4\\u03ad\\u03bb\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03b3\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03af\\u03b5\\u03c2. \\u039c\\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03c1\\u03b5\\u03af\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03bd\\u03b1 \\u03c0\\u03c1\\u03bf\\u03c3\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03bc\\u03cc\\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 \\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03ba\\u03ad\\u03c4\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03c5 \\u03b5\\u03c6\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03bc\\u03cc\\u03b6\\u03bf\\u03bd\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03b7 \\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03bb\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b1 \\u039a\\u03b1\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03ae\\u03bc\\u03b1\\u03c4\\u03cc\\u03c2 \\u03c3\\u03b1\\u03c2, \\u03b3\\u03b9\\u03b1 \\u03bd\\u03b1 \\u03b4\\u03b9\\u03b1\\u03c3\\u03c6\\u03b1\\u03bb\\u03af\\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03cc\\u03c4\\u03b9 \\u03c4\\u03bf \\u03c0\\u03b1\\u03b9\\u03c7\\u03bd\\u03af\\u03b4\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03b1\\u03c2 \\u03b5\\u03bc\\u03c6\\u03b1\\u03bd\\u03af\\u03b6\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03b9 \\u03c3\\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03c2 \\u03b5\\u03bd\\u03cc\\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03c4\\u03b5\\u03c2 \\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03c5 \\u03c4\\u03bf\\u03c5 \\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03b9\\u03c1\\u03b9\\u03ac\\u03b6\\u03bf\\u03c5\\u03bd \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u03bb\\u03cd\\u03c4\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03b1. \\u03a1\\u03af\\u03be\\u03c4\\u03b5 \\u03bc\\u03b9\\u03b1 \\