:[\&quot;#Sale_BrowserSortOption_Price\&quot;],\&quot;facetValues\&quot;:[{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#Sale_BrowserSortOption_Price\&quot;],\&quot;type\&quot;:4,\&quot;filter\&quot;:null,\&quot;rgStoreTagFilter\&quot;:{\&quot;type\&quot;:6},\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:13},{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#Sale_BrowserSortOption_PopularPurchasedDiscounted\&quot;],\&quot;type\&quot;:0,\&quot;filter\&quot;:{\&quot;clauses\&quot;:[{\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;Must have\&quot;,\&quot;or_tags\&quot;:[\&quot;[Feature] Discounted\&quot;]}]},\&quot;rgStoreTagFilter\&quot;:{\&quot;type\&quot;:3,\&quot;value\&quot;:\&quot;discounted\&quot;},\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:14}],\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:13},{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#Sale_Preferences\&quot;],\&quot;facetValues\&quot;:[{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#UserPreference_HideOwnedItems\&quot;],\&quot;type\&quot;:3,\&quot;userPreference\&quot;:0,\&quot;filter\&quot;:null,\&quot;rgStoreTagFilter\&quot;:null,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:14},{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#UserPreference_HideWishlistedItems\&quot;],\&quot;type\&quot;:3,\&quot;userPreference\&quot;:1,\&quot;filter\&quot;:null,\&quot;rgStoreTagFilter\&quot;:null,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:15},{\&quot;name\&quot;:[\&quot;#UserPreference_HideIgnoredItems\&quot;],\&quot;type\&quot;:3,\&quot;userPreference\&quot;:2,\&quot;bEnabledByDefault\&quot;:true,\&quot;filter\&quot;:null,\&quot;rgStoreTagFilter\&quot;:null,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:16}],\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:14}],\&quot;min_capsule_matches_for_facet_values\&quot;:5,\&quot;max_facet_values_for_facet\&quot;:5,\&quot;facet_sort_order\&quot;:1,\&quot;capsule_style_per_row_array\&quot;:null,\&quot;single_item_style\&quot;:\&quot;library\&quot;,\&quot;store_filter\&quot;:{\&quot;type\&quot;:3,\&quot;value\&quot;:\&quot;has demo\&quot;},\&quot;cap_section_content\&quot;:true,\&quot;cap_section_row_count\&quot;:50,\&quot;show_as_demos\&quot;:true,\&quot;use_random_order\&quot;:true,\&quot;random_order_top_x\&quot;:0,\&quot;rtime32_last_modified\&quot;:1727461882,\&quot;show_on_tabs\&quot;:[20,22,26,25,27],\&quot;prefer_demo_store_page\&quot;:true,\&quot;default_subtitle\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;smart_section\&quot;:false,\&quot;cap_item_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;label_color\&quot;:\&quot;rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\&quot;},{\&quot;capsules\&quot;:[],\&quot;events\&quot;:[],\&quot;links\&quot;:[],\&quot;localized_label\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;localized_label_image\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;default_label\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;section_type\&quot;:\&quot;text_section\&quot;,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:84007,\&quot;background_gradient_bottom\&quot;:\&quot;rgba(28, 24, 23, 1)\&quot;,\&quot;background_gradient_top\&quot;:\&quot;rgba(28, 24, 23, 1)\&quot;,\&quot;internal_section_data\&quot;:null,\&quot;text_section_contents\&quot;:[\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]How to Next Fest[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]Play Demos: [\\\/b]Hover over any game and you'll immediately find a button to install the playable demo. Try one! Or try a dozen. \\n\\n[b]Wishlist Your Favorites:[\\\/b] Find a game you want to hear about when it launches? Hover over any game and click the star icon in the upper-right corner to add it to your wishlist. You'll get a spiffy email notification when that game releases.\\n\\n[b]How is Next Fest organized?[\\\/b]\\nNext Fest kicks off with most sections sorted randomly. Steam uses what it learns in the first few days of the Fest to better recommend games to players from Wednesday onward..\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Wie funktioniert die Spielevorschau?[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]Spielen Sie Demos:[\\\/b] Fahren Sie mit der Maus \\u00fcber ein beliebiges Spiel und es wird Ihnen sofort eine Schaltfl\\u00e4che zur Installation der Demo angezeigt. Probieren Sie eine aus! Oder ein Dutzend! \\n\\n[b]Setzen Sie Ihre Favoriten auf die Wunschliste:[\\\/b] Sie haben ein Spiel gefunden, \\u00fcber dessen Ver\\u00f6ffentlichung Sie benachrichtigt werden m\\u00f6chten? Fahren Sie mit der Maus \\u00fcber das Spiel und klicken Sie auf das Sternsymbol in der rechten oberen Ecke, um es Ihrer Wunschliste hinzuzuf\\u00fcgen. Sie erhalten dann eine E-Mail-Benachrichtigung, sobald das Spiel ver\\u00f6ffentlicht wird.\\n\\n[b]Wie wird die Spielevorschau organisiert?[\\\/b]\\nDie Spielevorschau beginnt mit einer zuf\\u00e4lligen Sortierung der meisten Bereiche. Die Erkenntnisse der ersten Tage werden dann genutzt, um Spielern ab Mittwoch f\\u00fcr sie interessante Spiele zu empfehlen.\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest, c'est quoi\\u00a0?[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]Jouez \\u00e0 des d\\u00e9mos\\u00a0: [\\\/b]survolez le jeu qui vous int\\u00e9resse et installez sa d\\u00e9mo en cliquant sur le bouton \\u00ab\\u00a0Installer la d\\u00e9mo\\u00a0\\u00bb qui apparait. Essayez-en une, voire des dizaines\\u00a0! \\n\\n[b]Ajoutez vos jeux pr\\u00e9f\\u00e9r\\u00e9s \\u00e0 votre liste de souhaits\\u00a0:[\\\/b] vous voulez savoir quand un jeu qui vous int\\u00e9resse sortira\\u00a0? Survolez-le et cliquez sur l'ic\\u00f4ne en forme d'\\u00e9toile en haut \\u00e0 droite pour l'ajouter \\u00e0 votre liste de souhaits. Un joli petit e-mail vous sera envoy\\u00e9 le jour de sa sortie.\\n\\n[b]Comment N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest est-il organis\\u00e9\\u00a0?[\\\/b]\\nAu d\\u00e9but de N\\u00e9o\\u00a0Fest, la plupart des sections sont affich\\u00e9es sans ordre particulier. Steam tire les enseignements des premiers jours du festival pour am\\u00e9liorer les recommandations de jeux au public \\u00e0 partir du mercredi.\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Conosci il Next Fest?[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]Gioca alle demo: [\\\/b]fai passare il cursore del mouse su qualsiasi gioco per fare apparire un pulsante per installare la demo giocabile. Provane una! O provane un mucchio. \\n\\n[b]Aggiungi i tuoi preferiti alla Lista dei desideri:[\\\/b] hai trovato un gioco di cui vuoi seguire il lancio, quando sar\\u00e0 il suo momento? Passa il cursore su qualunque gioco e clicca sull'icona a forma di stella nell'angolo in alto a destra per aggiungerlo alla tua Lista dei desideri. Riceverai una notifica via e-mail quando il gioco sar\\u00e0 rilasciato.\\n\\n[b]Com'\\u00e8 organizzato il Next Fest?[\\\/b]\\nIl Next Fest inizia con la maggior parte delle sezioni in ordine casuale. Steam utilizzer\\u00e0 ci\\u00f2 che impara nel corso dei primi giorni del festival per consigliare meglio i titoli ai giocatori da mercoled\\u00ec in avanti.\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]Steam Next Fest\\ub97c \\uc990\\uae30\\ub294 \\ubc29\\ubc95[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]\\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774: [\\\/b]\\uac8c\\uc784\\uc5d0 \\ub9c8\\uc6b0\\uc2a4\\ub97c \\uc62c\\ub9ac\\uba74 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774 \\uac00\\ub2a5\\ud55c \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud310\\uc744 \\ubc14\\ub85c \\uc124\\uce58\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub294 \\ubc84\\ud2bc\\uc774 \\ud45c\\uc2dc\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud558\\ub098\\ub97c \\uace8\\ub77c \\ud55c\\ubc88 \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud574 \\ubcf4\\uc138\\uc694! \\ubb3c\\ub860 \\ub354 \\ub9ce\\uc740 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud558\\uc2e4 \\uc218\\ub3c4 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\n\\n[b]\\ub9c8\\uc74c\\uc5d0 \\ub4dc\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ucc1c \\ubaa9\\ub85d\\uc5d0 \\ucd94\\uac00:[\\\/b] \\ucd9c\\uc2dc\\uac00 \\uae30\\ub2e4\\ub824\\uc9c0\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ucc3e\\uc73c\\uc168\\ub098\\uc694? \\uc6d0\\ud558\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc5d0 \\ub9c8\\uc6b0\\uc2a4\\ub97c \\uc62c\\ub9b0 \\ud6c4 \\uc624\\ub978\\ucabd \\uc0c1\\ub2e8 \\ubaa8\\uc11c\\ub9ac\\uc5d0 \\uc788\\ub294 \\ubcc4 \\uc544\\uc774\\ucf58\\uc744 \\ud074\\ub9ad\\ud558\\uc5ec \\ucc1c \\ubaa9\\ub85d\\uc5d0 \\ucd94\\uac00\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694. \\ud574\\ub2f9 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc774 \\ucd9c\\uc2dc\\ub418\\uba74 \\uc774\\uba54\\uc77c \\uc54c\\ub9bc\\uc744 \\ubc1b\\uc73c\\uc2e4 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[b]Steam Next Fest \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uad6c\\uc131:[\\\/b]\\nSteam Next Fest \\uc2dc\\uc791 \\uc2dc\\uc5d0\\ub294 \\ub300\\ubd80\\ubd84\\uc758 \\uc139\\uc158\\uc774 \\ubb34\\uc791\\uc704\\ub85c \\uc815\\ub82c\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc774\\ud6c4 Steam\\uc5d0\\uc11c Steam Next Fest\\uac00 \\uc9c4\\ud589\\ub418\\ub294 \\uccab \\uba70\\uce60 \\ub3d9\\uc548 \\uc815\\ubcf4\\ub97c \\uc218\\uc9d1\\ud558\\uace0 \\uc774\\ub97c \\ubc14\\ud0d5\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc218\\uc694\\uc77c\\ubd80\\ud130 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\uc5b4\\uc5d0\\uac8c \\ub354 \\uc801\\ud569\\ud55c \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ucd94\\ucc9c\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]C\\u00f3mo participar en el Next\\u00a0Fest[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]Prueba demos:[\\\/b] pasa el cursor sobre cualquier juego y de inmediato ver\\u00e1s un bot\\u00f3n para instalar la demo jugable. \\u00a1Prueba una! O una docena. \\n\\n[b]A\\u00f1ade tus favoritos a tu lista de deseados:[\\\/b] \\u00bfhas encontrado un juego del que te gustar\\u00eda recibir informaci\\u00f3n cuando se lance? Pasa el cursor sobre cualquier juego y haz clic en el icono de la estrella en la esquina superior derecha para a\\u00f1adirlo a tu lista de deseados. Recibir\\u00e1s una elegante notificaci\\u00f3n por correo electr\\u00f3nico cuando se lance ese juego.\\n\\n[b]C\\u00f3mo se organiza el Next\\u00a0Fest[\\\/b]\\nCuando empieza el Next\\u00a0Fest, la mayor\\u00eda de las secciones se ordenan al azar. A partir del mi\\u00e9rcoles, Steam utiliza lo aprendido durante los primeros d\\u00edas del festival para ofrecer recomendaciones personalizadas a los jugadores.\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[\\\/classname]\&quot;,\&quot;[classname=EventDescCont]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescTitle]\\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282\\u600e\\u4e48\\u901b[\\\/classname]\\n\\n[classname=EventDescText]\\n[b]\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u6e38\\u620f\\uff1a[\\\/b]\\u5c06\\u9f20\\u6807\\u60ac\\u505c\\u5728\\u4efb\\u610f\\u6e38\\u620f\\u4e0a\\uff0c\\u5373\\u53ef\\u770b\\u5230\\u5b89\\u88c5\\u53ef\\u73a9\\u8bd5\\u7528\\u7248\\u7684\\u6309\\u94ae\\u3002\\u9a6c\\u4e0a\\u627e\\u4e00\\u6b3e\\u8bd5\\u8bd5\\uff01\\u6216\\u8005\\u8bd5\\u4e0a\\u4e00\\u6253\\uff01 \\n\\n[b]\\u5c06\\u6700\\u7231\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u52a0\\u5165\\u613f\\u671b\\u5355\\uff1a[\\\/b]\\u53d1\\u73b0\\u5fc3\\u4eea\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\uff0c\\u5e0c\\u671b\\u5728\\u5176\\u53d1\\u884c\\u65f6\\u6536\\u5230\\u901a\\u77e5\\uff1f\\u5c06\\u9f20\\u6807\\u60ac\\u505c\\u5728\\u4efb\\u610f\\u6e38\\u620f\\u4e0a\\uff0c\\u70b9\\u51fb\\u53f3\\u4e0a\\u89d2\\u7684\\u661f\\u5f62\\u56fe\\u6807\\u5373\\u53ef\\u5c06\\u5176\\u52a0\\u5165\\u81ea\\u5df1\\u7684\\u613f\\u671b\\u5355\\u3002\\u8be5\\u6e38\\u620f\\u53d1\\u884c\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u60a8\\u5c31\\u4f1a\\u6536\\u5230\\u9192\\u76ee\\u7684\\u7535\\u5b50\\u90ae\\u4ef6\\u901a\\u77e5\\u3002\\n\\n[b]\\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282\\u9875\\u9762\\u662f\\u5982\\u4f55\\u7ec4\\u7ec7\\u6574\\u7406\\u7684\\uff1f[\\\/b]\\n\\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282\\u5f00\\u5e55\\u65f6\\u5927\\u90e8\\u5206\\u680f\\u76ee\\u662f\\u968f\\u673a\\u6392\\u5e8f\\u7684\\u3002 Steam \\u4f1a\\u5229\\u7528\\u65b0\\u54c1\\u8282\\u6700\\u521d\\u51e0\\u5929\\u4e86\\u89e3\\u5230\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u606f\\uff0c\\u4ece\\u5468\\u4e09\\u8d77\\u66f4\\u597d\\u5730\\u5411\\u73a9\\u5bb6\\u63a8\\u8350\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\